WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.595
An absolute rollercoaster.

00:00:09.792 --> 00:00:11.224
I got to learn about myself.&nbsp;

00:00:11.224 --> 00:00:12.723
I got to learn how to open up,

00:00:12.723 --> 00:00:14.711
I got to learn how to put myself out there.&nbsp;

00:00:14.711 --> 00:00:17.040
Once in a lifetime.
Once in a lifetime, yeah.&nbsp;

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.336
Kinda like being at summer camp.

00:00:18.336 --> 00:00:20.113
Where you just bond with people and suddenly,

00:00:20.113 --> 00:00:22.983
you’re telling them your deepest, darkest secrets.

00:00:22.983 --> 00:00:26.021
I was like: ‘’Look, I’m gonna go and 
have as much&nbsp;fun as I possibly can

00:00:26.021 --> 00:00:27.228
 while it lasts.’’

00:00:27.973 --> 00:00:29.365
And then ten episodes later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.209
I’m in the final with my girlfriend.

00:00:31.346 --> 00:00:32.864
It was an absolute blast, 

00:00:32.864 --> 00:00:36.343
I met some of&nbsp;&nbsp;the funniest, hottest, cool people.

00:00:36.343 --> 00:00:38.520
Everyone was super open-minded.&nbsp;

00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:41.588
Amazing, I felt like I learnt a&nbsp;
lot. 

00:00:41.588 --> 00:00:43.380
Like, Lana showed me so much.&nbsp;

00:00:43.577 --> 00:00:45.736
It was such an enjoyable experience 

00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:49.427
and I think&nbsp;it’s something that everyone should try at least&nbsp;once,

00:00:49.427 --> 00:00:50.757
if they have the opportunity.

00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:57.208
Although it was very hard to share a room&nbsp;
with twelve people that I just had met.&nbsp;

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.000
Good morning beautiful people!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.365
I can say that’s one of my favorite memories now.&nbsp;

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:08.580
I miss so much hearing all the morning jokes,&nbsp;
staring at their morning-just-woke-up faces,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:12.000
gossiping with the girls about all&nbsp;
the drama going on in the house.&nbsp;

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.462
My favorite memory probably has to be when&nbsp;
Lana popped out of that sunroof,

00:01:19.462 --> 00:01:21.914
and it was&nbsp;revealed that we were on Too Hot To Handle.

00:01:21.914 --> 00:01:26.820
I can truly say that I had absolutely no idea.&nbsp;

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:32.160
My most impactful memories and parts for&nbsp;
me, was when we had that all boys workshop.&nbsp;

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:34.693
I’ve always, like, used the yoni for myself,

00:01:34.693 --> 00:01:36.060
without taking, like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:39.151
the yoni’s owner into consideration. 

00:01:39.363 --> 00:01:41.160
We really shared our vulnerabilities

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:44.006
through our day conversations and, yeah, 

00:01:44.006 --> 00:01:46.740
just&nbsp;understanding where all the boys kinda come from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.466
while we were in this retreat together. 

00:01:48.648 --> 00:01:51.792
That&nbsp;was something that I really enjoyed because &nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.792 --> 00:01:54.699
we all kind of connected on our vulnerabilities.

00:01:54.699 --> 00:01:57.190
Seeing Jawa win was great, for not only me,

00:01:57.190 --> 00:02:01.126
but everybody else and seeing everybody&nbsp;
come together, no matter who won,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:04.106
that was what makes us a family.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:10.800
The hardest part of the experience for me&nbsp;
was choosing between Dom, Kayla and Jawa.&nbsp;

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:13.200
I wish I had the chance to get&nbsp;
in everyone’s bed but I can’t.&nbsp;

00:02:13.549 --> 00:02:16.332
Walking to the room and seeing Brittan in the bed&nbsp;with James.

00:02:16.332 --> 00:02:17.831
Got a new sleeping partner have I?&nbsp;

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.119
Didn’t deal with that very well.

00:02:20.119 --> 00:02:21.557
The world was going to get

00:02:22.499 --> 00:02:25.076
to look in with a fine&nbsp;tooth comb 

00:02:25.076 --> 00:02:29.168
 at my emotions and how I was feeling in&nbsp;a relationship that, 

00:02:29.168 --> 00:02:30.960
you know, I put my all into.&nbsp;

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.297
That was a hard experience for me.

00:02:33.297 --> 00:02:35.439
I usually say communication is&nbsp;my strong suit. 

00:02:35.621 --> 00:02:38.760
But man, having to&nbsp;
really expose yourself and talk about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:43.120
everything, from your heart and your feelings&nbsp;and your emotions

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.519
to people you that have never met&nbsp;in your entire life...

00:02:45.959 --> 00:02:48.924
Man, it’s definitely tough.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:55.976
I’m a lot more open to new relationships,&nbsp;new beginnings. 

00:02:56.052 --> 00:03:00.820
Having more respect and&nbsp;&nbsp;love and care for myself, and my&nbsp;body, so...

00:03:01.656 --> 00:03:03.539
Lana, you did your thing!

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.900
I think I turned the naughty Nigel&nbsp;
switch back on, Lana. I’m so sorry!&nbsp;

00:03:07.569 --> 00:03:12.242
I’ve been trying to focus that abundance&nbsp;
of feelings into different outlets,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.318 --> 00:03:15.463
so I’ve been writing poetry and fantasy&nbsp;
short stories. 

00:03:15.463 --> 00:03:16.860
I’m going to ballet again.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:19.344
Since filming, I’ve been a busy boy.

00:03:19.344 --> 00:03:21.116
I’m the&nbsp;founder of a tech company,

00:03:21.116 --> 00:03:24.614
 I was flying all&nbsp;around to see all my castmates that I love.

00:03:24.827 --> 00:03:27.693
Since filming, I've been working really, really hard

00:03:27.693 --> 00:03:30.456
on building up my&nbsp;lifestyle content for my social media,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.456 --> 00:03:36.067
and also I was nominated to the People’s Choice&nbsp;
Awards as Best Latin influencer, 

00:03:36.257 --> 00:03:37.442
and I won!&nbsp;

00:03:39.568 --> 00:03:42.119
Brittan and I took a little bit of a break&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.934
when we got back from Too Hot To Handle.

00:03:44.934 --> 00:03:48.000
We both had this new perspective from&nbsp;Lana,

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.000
and we both just didn’t really&nbsp;know where we stood with each other.&nbsp;

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.780
We both moved to Los Angeles,&nbsp;
started seeing each other a lot more.&nbsp;

00:03:54.780 --> 00:04:00.120
I guess you can say James and I are in&nbsp;
the dating phase, the dating process.&nbsp;

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.313
Man, it feels great to say that.

00:04:01.556 --> 00:04:04.224
Undefined, ladies don’t kiss and tell.&nbsp;

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:06.523
I am single and ready to mingle though.

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:07.860
I am not single.&nbsp;

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:10.020
I’m gonna probably stay single&nbsp;
for a little bit longer.&nbsp;

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.915
So, I’m currently single.

00:04:11.915 --> 00:04:12.720
Very complicated.&nbsp;

00:04:13.935 --> 00:04:15.310
In a relationship.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.000
At first, Seb and I&nbsp;were dating for a few months. 

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.836
I travelled&nbsp;to Scotland. 

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.854
It was a lot, all at once.&nbsp;

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:26.940
The long distance got really difficult for&nbsp;
us both, which was, it was always a fear.&nbsp;

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:31.380
The one thing that scares me most: the person I’m&nbsp;
falling for lives on the other side of the world.&nbsp;

00:04:31.896 --> 00:04:39.420
We ended up ending things mutually&nbsp;
but we did not stop communication.&nbsp;

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.780
I’m still very much in love with her.
I think we’ve got enough memories&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.795
to continue something together.

00:04:44.795 --> 00:04:49.043
So hopefully soon we’ll give things another try.&nbsp;

00:04:49.362 --> 00:04:52.427
Guys, I’m single and I’m so not ready to mingle.

00:04:52.427 --> 00:04:54.720
Following the retreat I moved to London,

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.768
and we were together nonstop.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.690
I got my heart broken because I fell in love. 

00:05:01.494 --> 00:05:04.680
I got to live together with&nbsp;
Nick and eventually things didn’t work out.&nbsp;

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:08.143
I need myself and I need&nbsp;
my foundations established.&nbsp;

00:05:08.143 --> 00:05:12.780
I’m focusing on me, doing what I&nbsp;
want to do, exploring my curiosities.&nbsp;

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:19.140
I’m gonna spend my twenties just loving, and&nbsp;
growing and just evolving as a young woman.

